rule SyntheticTimeSemantics
	statement: All data is synthetic Zava Security (a fictional company) demo data and supports no claims about any real company or operation. Scenario-clock telemetry time is separate from actual UTC operator action timestamps, which can be later. Alert status reflects current record state, not a historical as-of snapshot.
	lineageTag: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-f6c80a3a7a1e

	ruleReferencedEntity ScenarioClock
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty asOf

	ruleReferencedEntity Alert
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty status

		ruleReferencedProperty createdAt

		ruleReferencedProperty resolvedAt

	ruleReferencedEntity FleetEvent
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty occurredAt

